    "title": "Dancing Hair",
    "description": "This is a lighthearted game, a new way to enjoy the music!\r\nBecome the tangled princess, avoid obstacles and finish the fashion runway. Get super long majestic hair to the rhythm of music.\r\n\r\nAt Dancing Hair, you can experience music of different styles and singers, and change your modeling with amazing and interesting choices! \r\n\r\n\u3010Easy to play\u3011\r\n- Swipe left and right\r\n- Try to get more hair to get more rewards\r\n- Be careful not to encounter obstacles\r\n\r\n\u3010Game Features\u3011\r\n- Simple game control experience\r\n- Number of songs to satisfy different tastes\r\n\r\n\u3010Music Choices\u3011\r\n- Hot songs as: Dance Monkey/Despacito/How You Like That/Senorita.\r\n- Super artists as: Ava Max/Lady Gaga/Post Malone/Billie Eilish/Justin Bieber.\r\n\r\nTry it now! Music lovers will love it!\r\n\r\nIf any producer or record label has a problem with any of the music used in the game please email us and if necessary it will be removed immediately (including images used).\r\n\r\nHow to contact us:\r\nPlease send an email to contact@tinymaxgames.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "This is a lighthearted game, a new way to enjoy the music!<br>Become the tangled princess, avoid obstacles and finish the fashion runway. Get super long majestic hair to the rhythm of music.<br><br>At Dancing Hair, you can experience music of different styles and singers, and change your modeling with amazing and interesting choices! <br><br>\u3010Easy to play\u3011<br>- Swipe left and right<br>- Try to get more hair to get more rewards<br>- Be careful not to encounter obstacles<br><br>\u3010Game Features\u3011<br>- Simple game control experience<br>- Number of songs to satisfy different tastes<br><br>\u3010Music Choices\u3011<br>- Hot songs as: Dance Monkey/Despacito/How You Like That/Senorita.<br>- Super artists as: Ava Max/Lady Gaga/Post Malone/Billie Eilish/Justin Bieber.<br><br>Try it now! Music lovers will love it!<br><br>If any producer or record label has a problem with any of the music used in the game please email us and if necessary it will be removed immediately (including images used).<br><br>How to contact us:<br>Please send an email to contact@tinymaxgames.com",
